ver, this PR only exposes it to the user by allowing to choose anisotropic filters in the Viewport (a wrapper for the RenderingServer one), and in the Project Settings (specifically for the root Viewport).\r\n\r\nNot sure whether some docs would need to be updated (and how).\r\n\r\n-|Before|After\r\n-|-|-\r\nViewport|<img width=\"433\" height=\"181\" alt=\"YQaDcYicc6\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1a85536-577e-4ebf-8b75-85df449a5be0\" />|<img width=\"439\" height=\"221\" alt=\"ZkgxBRvAs4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8dc328e-27ef-42c2-ab32-212b61078e98\" />\r\nProject Settings|<img width=\"787\" height=\"210\" alt=\"klPU7abrCH\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e0e7a0f-8faa-463d-b5a1-3ecf1634ff9e\" />|<img width=\"827\" height=\"275\" alt=\"7jBskHG0Q4\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/235e83c0-18f0-4520-a262-ae79c61afad5\" />\r\n\r\nNote the enums ordering is mismatched between Viewport and RenderingServer/CanvasItem, but it was already like that before:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0fdb93cde6ccb5176f96b0ddbba08d83e6c6aef2/scene/main/viewport.h#L188-L194\r\nvs:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0fdb93cde6ccb5176f96b0ddbba08d83e6c6aef2/servers/rendering/rendering_server.h#L928-L937\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0fdb93cde6ccb5176f96b0ddbba08d83e6c6aef2/scene/main/canvas_item.h#L52-L61\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"http